# scripts/security/external-agents.local
#
# User LaunchAgents deliberately managed by another repository (personal
# automation kept in a separate, possibly private checkout), not by this
# flake. The macOS security audit lists these as MANUAL ("verify against the
# managing repo") instead of undeclared-persistence WARN.
#
# One exact plist filename per line. Blank lines and '#' comments are
# ignored. A name matches both `<name>.plist` and `<name>.plist.disabled`.
# A LaunchAgent under the same prefix that is NOT listed here still WARNs.
#
# Copy to scripts/security/external-agents.local (gitignored) and edit.
#
# com.example.daily-thing.plist
# com.example.backup.plist
